<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/venezuela"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Venezuela.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Venezuela</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The oil industry is nationalised and PDVSA is created</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/socialist-republic-of-vietnam"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Socialist%20Republic%20of%20Vietnam.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Socialist Republic of Vietnam</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Socialist Republic of Vietnam is proclaimed and Saigon renamed Ho Chi Minh City</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-south-africa"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20South%20Africa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of South Africa</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Police fire on protesting students in Soweto, setting off a national uprising</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/language/ancient-greek"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Ancient%20Greek.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Ancient Greek</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Greece makes Demotic, the popular form of the language, its official language</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/anti-apartheid-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Anti-apartheid%20movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Anti-apartheid movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Soweto uprising begins with a schoolchildren’s march against teaching in Afrikaans</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/government/military-junta"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Military%20junta.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Military junta</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Argentina’s armed forces seize power; defeat in the Falklands War of 1982 forces them to hold elections in 1983</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/oxus-civilisation"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Oxus%20civilisation.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Oxus civilisation</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Viktor Sarianidi names the complex the Bactria–Margiana Archaeological Complex</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/derg"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Derg.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Derg</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 23 September the Red Terror begins after a failed attempt on Mengistu's life attributed to the EPRP; in less than two years up to 980,000 people are killed by the highest estimates.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/aboriginal-australians"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Aboriginal%20Australians.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Aboriginal Australians</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Aboriginal Land Rights Act lets Aboriginal people in the Northern Territory claim land by traditional association</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/solidarity"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Solidarity.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Solidarity</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Protests against rising food prices are followed by a crackdown on dissent, and groups such as KOR begin to build opposition networks</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/peronism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Peronism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Peronism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The military overthrows President Isabel Perón, opening the National Reorganization Process</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/the-tale-of-genji"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/The%20Tale%20of%20Genji.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>The Tale of Genji</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Edward Seidensticker publishes the first complete English translation</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/democratic-republic-of-vietnam"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Democratic%20Republic%20of%20Vietnam.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Democratic Republic of Vietnam</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">North and South Vietnam are officially reunited on 2 July as the Socialist Republic of Vietnam</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/mao-zedong"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mao%20Zedong.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mao Zedong</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Mao dies, aged 82, and is succeeded at first by Hua Guofeng</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-mohacs"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Moh%C3%A1cs.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Mohács</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The battlefield becomes a national historical memorial site on the 450th anniversary</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/hanoi"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hanoi.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hanoi</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Hanoi becomes the capital of the unified Socialist Republic of Vietnam</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/buenos-aires"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Buenos%20Aires.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Buenos Aires</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A coup led by General Jorge Videla begins the military dictatorship</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/truganini"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Truganini.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Truganini</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Her remains, held by the Tasmanian Museum, are cremated and scattered in the D'Entrecasteaux Channel</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/black-consciousness-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Black%20Consciousness%20Movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Black Consciousness Movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Black children march in Soweto against Afrikaans-medium teaching and security forces kill 176 protesters by the official count</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/christian-democracy"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Christian%20democracy.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Christian democracy</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The European People's Party is founded, after the European Union of Christian Democrats of 1965</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/jehovahs-witnesses"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Jehovah's%20Witnesses.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Jehovah's Witnesses</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Authority for doctrinal and organisational decisions passes from the Society's president to the Governing Body</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/hawaiian-religion"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hawaiian%20religion.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hawaiian religion</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Members of Protect Kahoʻolawe ʻOhana file suit over the Navy's use of Kahoʻolawe for target practice, citing cultural and religious sites</span></li></ul></section>
